{"seq":3,"slug":"carbon-footprint-audit-verify","title":"碳足迹核算核查与审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/emission-reduce-offset/carbon-footprint-audit-verify","wordCount":1907,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"碳足迹核算核查与审计\">碳足迹核算核查与审计</h1><p>一份碳足迹报告的价值上限，等于它能被第三方复算的程度。审计算不出你的数字，不是它不信你，是它没有证据链。核查与审计要做的事情可以概括成一句：<strong>让第三方只凭你提供的记录，独立重算出同一个数字</strong>。这一篇讲怎么让核算系统天然具备这个能力，而不是在审计前临时补材料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>温室气体核验的标准框架是 ISO 14064-3，它规定了温室气体声明的核证与核查的规范与指南。核证（verification）针对的是历史数据的声明，核查（validation）针对的是面向未来的假设与计划。两者的保证等级分两档：<strong>合理保证</strong>（更高，要求证据充分且核查方主动取证）与<strong>有限保证</strong>（较低，主要依赖询问与分析性程序）。</p>\n<p>跨境场景里最硬的核验要求来自 CBAM。其正式期的核验规则由专门的实施与授权法案落地：Implementing Regulation (EU) 2025/2546 规定核验原则的应用，Delegated Regulation (EU) 2025/2551 规定认可与核验，面向核验机构与国家认可机构的委员会指南则在 2026 年 8 月发布（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism/cbam-legislation-and-guidance_en\">CBAM 立法与指南</a>）。这套安排的实务含义是：<strong>核验不是一份自由格式的意见书，而是被规定了方法的程序</strong>，你的证据链必须按它的取数口径组织，否则核验方无法出具可用于申报的结论。相比之下，商品碳标签的核验通常按 ISO 14064-3 的保证等级与 ISO 14083 的运输链要素拆分来进行——后者把整链声明分解成若干可单独核算的片段，让跨多个承运商的声明能逐段被核查，见 <a href=\"../../fulfillment-emission-calc/transport-mode-distance-model\">运输方式与里程碳排放模型</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[审计准备] --&gt; B[数据血缘]&#10;  A --&gt; C[假设与截断记录]&#10;  A --&gt; D[可复算证据链]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[每条排放 -&gt; 因子 -&gt; 活动数据 -&gt; 原始凭证]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[截止准则的应用记录]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[分摊基础的声明理由]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[估算值的使用范围]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[版本锁定]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[重算脚本可执行]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[差异可解释]&#10;  A --&gt; E[发现项分类]&#10;  E --&gt; E1[重大错报]&#10;  E --&gt; E2[一般偏差]&#10;  E --&gt; E3[改进建议]\">graph TD\n  A[审计准备] --&gt; B[数据血缘]\n  A --&gt; C[假设与截断记录]\n  A --&gt; D[可复算证据链]\n  B --&gt; B1[每条排放 -&gt; 因子 -&gt; 活动数据 -&gt; 原始凭证]\n  C --&gt; C1[截止准则的应用记录]\n  C --&gt; C2[分摊基础的声明理由]\n  C --&gt; C3[估算值的使用范围]\n  D --&gt; D1[版本锁定]\n  D --&gt; D2[重算脚本可执行]\n  D --&gt; D3[差异可解释]\n  A --&gt; E[发现项分类]\n  E --&gt; E1[重大错报]\n  E --&gt; E2[一般偏差]\n  E --&gt; E3[改进建议]</pre><p>三条准备路径对应三类最常见的审计发现：数据血缘断了（说不清某个数字从哪来）、假设没记录（审计方不知道你为什么排除了某个阶段）、证据链不可复算（拿同样的数据算不出同样的结果）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据血缘与凭证留存\">数据血缘与凭证留存</h2><h3 id=\"内容哈希与缺凭证视图\">内容哈希与缺凭证视图</h3><p>碳核算里的每个数字都要能向上追溯到原始凭证。所谓原始凭证，指的是电费单、燃料发票、提货单、承运商账单、能源管理系统日志——不是&quot;我们系统里的记录&quot;，而是记录本身的来源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 证据链：一条排放记录对应一组凭证&#10;CREATE TABLE emission_evidence (&#10;  evidence_id     TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  pcf_run_id      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  emission_ref    TEXT NOT NULL,          -- 指向具体某条排放记录&#10;  evidence_type   TEXT NOT NULL,          -- utility_bill / fuel_invoice&#10;                                          -- / bol / carrier_statement / ems_log&#10;  document_uri    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  document_hash   TEXT NOT NULL,          -- 内容哈希，防篡改&#10;  period_start    DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  period_end      DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  issuer          TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  retention_until DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  UNIQUE (pcf_run_id, emission_ref, document_uri)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 审计视图：哪些排放记录缺少凭证&#10;CREATE VIEW audit_evidence_gap AS&#10;SELECT e.pcf_run_id, e.emission_ref, e.stage_code, e.kg_co2e&#10;FROM pcf_stage_emission e&#10;LEFT JOIN emission_evidence v&#10;  ON v.pcf_run_id = e.pcf_run_id AND v.emission_ref = e.emission_ref&#10;WHERE v.evidence_id IS NULL&#10;  AND e.source_tier &lt;= 2          -- tier 1/2 必须有凭证&#10;ORDER BY e.kg_co2e DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 证据链：一条排放记录对应一组凭证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> emission_evidence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pcf_run_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  emission_ref    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 指向具体某条排放记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- utility_bill / fuel_invoice</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                          -- / bol / carrier_statement / ems_log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  document_uri    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  document_hash   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 内容哈希，防篡改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  period_start    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  period_end      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  issuer          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  retention_until </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (pcf_run_id, emission_ref, document_uri)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 审计视图：哪些排放记录缺少凭证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> audit_evidence_gap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pcf_run_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">emission_ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stage_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">kg_co2e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pcf_stage_emission e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> emission_evidence v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pcf_run_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pcf_run_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">emission_ref</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">emission_ref</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">evidence_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">source_tier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          -- tier 1/2 必须有凭证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">kg_co2e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>document_hash</code> 这一列是防篡改的关键：审计方可以自己下载凭证算一遍哈希，与系统记录比对。如果凭证被替换过，哈希对不上。这不是形式主义——跨境项目里因供应商事后修改发票而导致的前后不一致是真实存在的风险。</p>\n<p><code>retention_until</code> 是另一个容易漏掉的字段。碳数据通常没有强制保留期的统一规定，但审计实践上至少要覆盖到&quot;该年度披露的有效期结束&quot;（例如 CBAM 申报被质疑的追溯期、商品标签的有效期）。把这个日期做成字段并在到期前提醒，比事后发现凭证已被清理好得多。</p>\n<p><code>audit_evidence_gap</code> 这个视图的做法有一个通用价值：<strong>把&quot;缺什么&quot;变成可查询的结果，而不是等审计方指出来</strong>。建议把它接进日常监控，让缺失凭证的比例成为核算团队的运营指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"假设与截断的显式记录\">假设与截断的显式记录</h2><h3 id=\"估算值必须附敏感度分析\">估算值必须附敏感度分析</h3><p>审计发现里最难处理的一类不是错，而是&quot;说不清&quot;。某个阶段为什么没算、某个分摊为什么选这个基础、某个估算值为什么用这个数——如果这些只存在于工程师记忆里，审计方只能标为不可核验。</p>\n<p>推荐的记录方式是给每次核算运行挂一份结构化的假设清单：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;pcf_run_id&quot;: &quot;PCF-2026-Q1-0031&quot;,&#10;  &quot;assumptions&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;A1&quot;,&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;cutoff&quot;,&#10;      &quot;stage&quot;: &quot;use_phase&quot;,&#10;      &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;stage_share &lt; 1% AND cumulative_cut &lt;= 5%&quot;,&#10;      &quot;observed_share_pct&quot;: 0.0,&#10;      &quot;justification&quot;: &quot;无源家居件, 无使用能耗&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;A2&quot;,&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;allocation&quot;,&#10;      &quot;scope&quot;: &quot;ocean_leg&quot;,&#10;      &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;volume&quot;,&#10;      &quot;justification&quot;: &quot;该航线容积先于载重用完&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;A3&quot;,&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;estimate&quot;,&#10;      &quot;scope&quot;: &quot;supplier_electricity&quot;,&#10;      &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;area_intensity&quot;,&#10;      &quot;source_tier&quot;: 4,&#10;      &quot;justification&quot;: &quot;供应商无分表, 采用同类型工厂平均强度&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;A4&quot;,&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;factor_selection&quot;,&#10;      &quot;scope&quot;: &quot;grid_region&quot;,&#10;      &quot;factor_ref&quot;: &quot;EF-DB-2026/DE-grid&quot;,&#10;      &quot;justification&quot;: &quot;仓库所在地电网区域&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;cut_off_summary&quot;: { &quot;cut_stages&quot;: [], &quot;total_cut_pct&quot;: 0.0, &quot;threshold_pct&quot;: 5.0 }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pcf_run_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PCF-2026-Q1-0031\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"assumptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cutoff\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"stage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"use_phase\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stage_share &#x3C; 1% AND cumulative_cut &#x3C;= 5%\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"observed_share_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"justification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"无源家居件, 无使用能耗\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"allocation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ocean_leg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"volume\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"justification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"该航线容积先于载重用完\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"estimate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supplier_electricity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"area_intensity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"source_tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"justification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"供应商无分表, 采用同类型工厂平均强度\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"factor_selection\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"grid_region\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"factor_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EF-DB-2026/DE-grid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"justification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"仓库所在地电网区域\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cut_off_summary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"cut_stages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"total_cut_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"threshold_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>cut_off_summary</code> 与假设清单合并在一起，让审计方能一眼看到&quot;你排除了哪些阶段、累计占多少、是否在阈值内&quot;。这与第 1 章讲的截止准则直接对应——那个 1%/5% 的联合判定在这里变成一条可核验的记录。见 <a href=\"../../pcf-method-boundary/pcf-iso14067-ghg-boundary\">ISO 14067 与 GHG Protocol 的边界划定</a>。</p>\n<p>假设清单里最容易被忽略的是 <code>estimate</code> 类。当数据只能取行业平均时，审计方一定会问&quot;你为什么用这个值&quot;。答案必须包含三个要素：为什么拿不到实测数据、为什么选了这一档强度、这个选择对结果的影响幅度（敏感度）。第三条尤其重要——<strong>如果换用另一档合理值会显著改变结论，就必须做敏感度分析而不是二选一</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"版本锁定与可复算\">版本锁定与可复算</h2><h3 id=\"冻结后只能新增运行-不能覆盖\">冻结后只能新增运行，不能覆盖</h3><p>可复算的最低标准是：给定同一批活动数据、同一版因子库、同一版规则，系统必须输出同一个数字。这要求三样东西都被锁定并有版本号：<strong>活动数据快照</strong>、<strong>因子库版本</strong>、<strong>规则配置版本</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 核算运行：锁定三个版本，禁止事后修改&#10;CREATE TABLE pcf_run (&#10;  pcf_run_id        TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  entity_scope      TEXT NOT NULL,       -- product / order_batch / site&#10;  period_start      DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  period_end        DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  activity_snapshot TEXT NOT NULL,       -- 活动数据快照标识&#10;  factor_db_version TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_config_ver   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  gwp_basis         TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  method_ref        TEXT NOT NULL,       -- ISO 14067:2018 等&#10;  computed_at       TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  computed_by       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  total_kg_co2e     NUMERIC(20,6) NOT NULL,&#10;  status            TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (status IN&#10;                      (&#39;draft&#39;,&#39;frozen&#39;,&#39;verified&#39;,&#39;superseded&#39;))&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 冻结后禁止修改: 只能新建一次运行并标记旧运行 superseded&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION guard_frozen_run() RETURNS trigger AS $$&#10;BEGIN&#10;  IF OLD.status IN (&#39;frozen&#39;,&#39;verified&#39;) THEN&#10;    RAISE EXCEPTION &#39;pcf_run % is frozen; create a new run instead&#39;, OLD.pcf_run_id;&#10;  END IF;&#10;  RETURN NEW;&#10;END; $$ LANGUAGE plpgsql;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 核算运行：锁定三个版本，禁止事后修改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pcf_run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pcf_run_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_scope      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- product / order_batch / site</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  period_start      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  period_end        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  activity_snapshot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 活动数据快照标识</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  factor_db_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_config_ver   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gwp_basis         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  method_ref        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ISO 14067:2018 等</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  computed_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  computed_by       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  total_kg_co2e     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                      (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'draft'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'frozen'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'verified'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'superseded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 冻结后禁止修改: 只能新建一次运行并标记旧运行 superseded</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> guard_frozen_run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURNS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trigger </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  IF</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> OLD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'frozen'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'verified'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RAISE EXCEPTION </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pcf_run % is frozen; create a new run instead'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">OLD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pcf_run_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  RETURN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NEW;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; $$ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LANGUAGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plpgsql;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>status</code> 状态机是这套结构的心脏：<code>draft</code> 可改，<code>frozen</code> 之后任何修改都必须新建一次运行并把旧的标为 <code>superseded</code>。这保证<strong>任何一个已对外披露过的数字都能被原样复现</strong>，而修正只以&quot;新增一次运行&quot;的形式出现，历史不被覆盖。这与第 3 章讲的展示值外键指向核算运行的设计是配套的，见 <a href=\"../../carbon-label-disclosure/carbon-label-product-display\">商品碳标签与买家展示</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审计视角下的三类发现\">审计视角下的三类发现</h2><h3 id=\"把检查内建到日常质量门\">把检查内建到日常质量门</h3><p>站在核查方的位置看，一份 PCF 报告的缺陷分三类，严重度递减：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>发现类型</th>\n<th>判定标准</th>\n<th>典型来源</th>\n<th>对声明的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重大错报</td>\n<td>总量错误超过约定的重要性水平</td>\n<td>漏掉真实阶段、分摊规则用错、单位换算错误、GWP 基准混用</td>\n<td>声明不能使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般偏差</td>\n<td>单阶段偏差超阈值，总量影响不重大</td>\n<td>因子版本不匹配、装载率假设偏乐观、用了邻区电力因子</td>\n<td>需修正后重申</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改进建议</td>\n<td>不影响本次声明，影响未来可核验性</td>\n<td>凭证不全、假设未文档化、缺少敏感度分析</td>\n<td>记录为整改项</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三类发现的应对是让它们都能在自己的系统里先被查出来，而不是等外部审计。具体做法是把 <code>audit_evidence_gap</code> 这类视图、假设清单的完整性检查、版本锁定的守卫函数全都纳入日常质量门，让&quot;可审计性&quot;成为核算流程的常态属性而不是审计季的临时冲刺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>审计的要求可以概括为&quot;第三方只凭你的记录独立重算出同一个数字&quot;。</li>\n<li>核证对历史数据、核查对未来假设；保证等级分合理保证与有限保证两档。</li>\n<li>每条排放记录要挂凭证，并用内容哈希防篡改；把&quot;缺凭证&quot;做成可查询视图。</li>\n<li>假设与截断必须结构化记录，尤其要包含估算值选择的敏感度分析。</li>\n<li>核算运行要锁定活动数据、因子库、规则配置三个版本，并用状态机禁止冻结后修改。</li>\n<li>审计发现分重大错报、一般偏差、改进建议三类；把这三类检查内建到日常质量门里。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"碳足迹核算核查与审计","id":"碳足迹核算核查与审计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"数据血缘与凭证留存","id":"数据血缘与凭证留存"},{"level":3,"text":"内容哈希与缺凭证视图","id":"内容哈希与缺凭证视图"},{"level":2,"text":"假设与截断的显式记录","id":"假设与截断的显式记录"},{"level":3,"text":"估算值必须附敏感度分析","id":"估算值必须附敏感度分析"},{"level":2,"text":"版本锁定与可复算","id":"版本锁定与可复算"},{"level":3,"text":"冻结后只能新增运行，不能覆盖","id":"冻结后只能新增运行-不能覆盖"},{"level":2,"text":"审计视角下的三类发现","id":"审计视角下的三类发现"},{"level":3,"text":"把检查内建到日常质量门","id":"把检查内建到日常质量门"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"碳抵消与碳信用声明规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/emission-reduce-offset/carbon-offset-credit-claim"},"next":null}